iPhone 6 which only has 1GB). \n\nTo see the reflection effects, you will need to set your Roblox Graphics Quality to a higher level in the game settings (ideally maximum or near maximum). Since the A14 has a budget processor, you might experience some FPS drops at max graphics in heavy games, but the script itself is highly optimized and lightweight to keep your performance as smooth as possible. Let me know if you test it!","parent":{"_id":"6a49ff12606332e287b74a4b","commentBy":{"_id":"6a49fec3e01df7635dc05def","username":"aiSCRIPTSmaker","profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","status":"offline","id":"6a49fec3e01df7635dc05def"},"text":"@ProReal  can it run on a samsung a14 galaxy?"},"edited":true,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-07-07T17:46:15.432Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"6a99630de61cc32fe2b1a32c","commentBy":{"_id":"6a1279777f9602bdd802f0e3","username":"NPC_PlayersNoob_Alt","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/1b16e3a39197ea3a7a3813e923aedb5e55d558179c61851cc2dfbb8156a2098f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a1279777f9602bdd802f0e3-1785668795917.png"},"lastActive":"2026-10-14T07:38:21.715Z","createdAt":"2026-05-24T04:07:19.232Z","lvl":8,"status":"offline","id":"6a1279777f9602bdd802f0e3","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":100000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/1b16e3a39197ea3a7a3813e923aedb5e55d558179c61851cc2dfbb8156a2098f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a1279777f9602bdd802f0e3-1785668795917.png"}},"text":"Not real SSR Shader Script like RoShade, And it's not what I expected.","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-09-03T12:07:41.479Z","liked":false,"disliked":false}]}